  "title": "Garmin adds Daily Weather and other features to Garmin Pilot app",
  "summary": "OLATHE, Kan./June 16, 2026 – Garmin (NYSE: GRMN) today announced new features and enhancements in the Garmin Pilot™ mobile app. Previously only available on Garmin Pilot Web, the Daily Weather feature is now available on Apple® mobile devices, allowing pilots to see future forecasts in a new Daily Weather tab. To help provide a smoother […]",
